      "redundancy_source": "NOT DETERMINED. Revit exposes no IsRedundant, and a redundant element reports zero area and no boundary exactly as an unenclosed one does. Declare the FailureDefinitionId guid your Revit uses for redundancy in spatial_rules.redundant_warning_guids; until then is_redundant is null and no element is called redundant.",
